sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Entra[Microsoft Entra ID]
    participant RBAC[Azure RBAC]
    participant Platform[Platform Resources]
    participant App[Application Resources]

    User->>Entra: authentication
    Entra->>RBAC: group or role assignment
    RBAC->>Platform: access grant
    RBAC->>App: workload access grant
    Platform-->>User: controlled operations
